      "title_en": "Question (south) — Dazhongsi key-area aerial",
      "description_zh": "空间关系取自 OSM 实测、可核：觉生寺与地铁13号线大钟寺站相距约 676 米（方位约 115°），13 号线走向约 175°，北三环西路距寺约 160 米；周边为「大盘子街区」——建筑逾 50 栋、基底合计约 15 公顷、单栋均值约 3000 平方米。与正文一致：古寺本体不动一砖一瓦；钟声广场退开院墙、无高差、同心声环铺装；钟架为独立结构、不与既有物相连、不高过成熟树冠。图为意象示意，未经坐标配准，用地与边界一律以规划图件为准。",
      "description_en": "The spatial relations are taken from verified OSM measurements: the Jueshengsi temple lies about 676 m from Dazhongsi station on Metro Line 13 (bearing about 115°), Line 13 runs at about 175°, and the North Third Ring West Road is about 160 m from the temple; the surrounding fabric is the 'big-plate block' — over 50 buildings, some 15 ha of footprint in total, averaging about 3,000 m² each. Consistent with the text: the temple itself is untouched; the Bell Chime Plaza stands clear of its walls, is free of level changes and paved in concentric sound rings; the bell frame is independent, attached to nothing existing, and never rises above the mature tree canopy. An atmosphere illustration: it is not coordinate-registered, and land use and boundaries follow the planning figures."
